  <h1>Privacy Policy for Reworded</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: 16 December 2025</p>

  <h2>1. General Information</h2>
  <p>Reworded is an iOS application designed to help users study flashcards.</p>
  <p>The app does not require registration and does not collect personal information such as names, email addresses, or account identifiers.</p>
  <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at:
    <a href="mailto:hey@reworded.cards">hey@reworded.cards</a>
  </p>

  <h2>2. Data Processed by the App</h2>
  <p>Reworded processes the following types of data:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Flashcard content created by the user</li>
    <li>Technical information necessary for the app to function properly (for example, basic system information provided by iOS)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Reworded does not collect analytics, advertising identifiers, or tracking data.</p>

  <h2>3. Local Storage and iCloud</h2>
  <p>All flashcards and related content are stored:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>locally on the user’s device, and/or</li>
    <li>in the user’s personal iCloud account, if iCloud sync is enabled by the user</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Reworded does not store flashcard content on its own servers and does not have access to the user’s iCloud data.</p>

  <h2>4. AI-Powered Features</h2>
  <p>Reworded offers an optional AI-powered hint feature.</p>
  <p>When a user explicitly requests an AI hint:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>the content of the selected flashcard (both sides) is sent from the app to Reworded’s backend API, which forwards this content to an external AI service provider (Google Gemini)</li>
    <li>the data is transmitted solely for the purpose of generating the requested hint</li>
    <li>the data is not stored by Reworded on its servers after the response is returned</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The AI feature is activated only by the user’s direct action.</p>
  <p>Reworded does not use flashcard content for training its own models.</p>

  <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>The AI hint feature relies on the following third-party service:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google Gemini (AI text generation)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Processing of data by this service is governed by the provider’s own privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>Reworded does not retain user-generated flashcard content on external servers.</p>
  <p>Flashcards remain on the user’s device or in the user’s iCloud account until the user deletes them.</p>

  <h2>7. User Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights under applicable data protection laws, including the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>access your data</li>
    <li>delete your data</li>
    <li>restrict or object to certain processing activities</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Since Reworded does not store flashcard content externally, these rights can generally be exercised directly within the app by managing or deleting your data.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time.</p>
  <p>The latest version will always be available within the app and on the App Store listing.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or data handling in Reworded, please contact:</p>
  <p>
    <a href="mailto:hey@reworded.cards">hey@reworded.cards</a>
  </p>
